# Game regression fixes

The user's current conversation defines the task and plan: fix best scores,
arrow navigation, reduced motion, and accidental audio under [the game
requirements](../../../../docs/README.md). Each fix has its own subagent; the
primary agent reviews and validates without editing code. Only one subagent
can run at a time.

Current step: best-score subagent finished; delegate keyboard navigation,
then reduced motion and silence. Required behavior: R10, I05–I13, V17–V18, S01–S02; preserve C12,
native input, timing, storage failure handling, normal motion, and announcements.

Observed causes: `rememberBest` unconditionally replaces the score;
`GameStatus` defaults the missing best to zero; board navigation is absent;
motion media overrides are absent; `use-game.ts` synthesizes match/win audio.

Best-score changes are in storage.ts, GameStatus.tsx, and
tests/persistence-contract.e2e.test.ts. The 17 focused storage/session tests
passed; browser validation is pending. Equal/worse results preserve preferences.

Initial tree had no tracked changes. Node is 26.12.1, npm is 11.20.0.
Locked dependency install and type checking passed. Chromium is downloading.
Full format check shows many pre-existing formatting issues in workspace/docs
and scripts/replay.test.ts; keep changes scoped. Final evidence should include type
checking, unit/static tests, fresh built browser journeys, and formatting.
